    37→**Verification**:
    38→1. Header shows source favicon and name (not article title)
    39→2. Down chevron collapses without changing article state
    40→3. Checkmark marks article as removed AND closes overlay
    41→4. Header background transitions from transparent (top) to frosted glass (scrolled)
    42→
