     4→# Plan A Implementation: Zen Overlay Header Redesign
     5→
     6→## Changes Made
     7→
     8→### 1. Updated Imports
     9→Added `Check`, `ChevronDown`, `useState`; removed `ChevronLeft`
    10→
    11→### 2. Updated ZenModeOverlay Signature
    12→Now accepts `hostname`, `displayDomain`, `articleMeta`, and `onMarkDone` props
    13→
    14→### 3. Added Scroll Tracking
    15→`hasScrolled` state triggers at 10px scroll depth
    16→
    17→### 4. Redesigned Layout
    18→- Header is now `absolute` over content, allowing text to scroll behind
    19→- Transparent at top → `bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md` when scrolled
    20→- Left: `ChevronDown` (collapse/save for later)
